Package: fwsunitr
Title: Interface to the FWS Unit REST API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "McCrea", family = "Cobb", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mccrea_cobb@fws.gov",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9412-1468"))
Description: Provides functions to retrieve U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service
    organizational unit information from the FWS Unit REST API. Includes access
    to unit subtypes, unit selectors with direct and indirect links, unit
    geography, and individual unit lookups. Responses are returned as tibbles.
